# Zero-copy virtio-vsock I/O over the Device Memory Buffer. The Amazon Linux
# 6.18 kernel defines this symbol in-tree from 6.18.54: it needs the premapped
# virtqueue add API, which upstream added in v6.13, so the 5.10 and 6.1
# patches carry the bounce path only. rebuild.sh therefore wires this fragment
# into the 6.18 builds alone.
CONFIG_VIRTIO_DMB_ZEROCOPY=y
